  "title": "CMake: Enable AUTO{MOC,UIC,RCC} for the qtui target explicitly.",
  "description": "The CMAKE_AUTO{MOC,UIC,RCC} macros set their respective properties for\nall targets. There's no sense in running Qt's meta-object, user\ninterface, or resource compilers on code outside of ui/qt, so just set\nthem for the qtui target. Ping #17314.",
