          "id": 569329009,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I tried here with CMake 3.20.0 and it failed to compile. I pushed and update to use CMAKE_AUTO* if we're running CMake 3.20.0 or 3.20.1, and to set the AUTO* properties directly otherwise.",
